// Logon With New Credentials (Logon Type 9)
// Detects a type 9 NewCredentials logon through seclogo, which is what runas /netonly produces and what Mimikatz sekurlsa::pth and similar token-making tools produce when they spawn a process with injected credentials. Event ID 4624.
// techniques: T1134.001,T1550.002   severity: medium   status: experimental
// validate: Atomic Red Team T1134.001
//   runas /netonly /user:CONTOSO\test cmd.exe
// source: rules/privilege-escalation/new-credentials-logon-type-9.yml  (GENERATED, do not edit by hand)
SecurityEvent
| where ((EventID == 4624) and (LogonType == 9) and (LogonProcessName =~ @"seclogo"))
